# QuizArena has two deployable apps, each with its own environment file:
#
#   apps/server/.env.example  → copy to apps/server/.env      (game server: API + WebSocket)
#   apps/web/.env.example     → copy to apps/web/.env.local   (Next.js frontend)
#
# Quick start:
#   cp apps/server/.env.example apps/server/.env
#   cp apps/web/.env.example apps/web/.env.local
#
# See README.md → "Environment variables" for the full reference.
